	(descr "Same Sky CMS-151103-088SP miniature speaker -- 15 x 11 x 3 mm rectangular frame, 0.7 W (1.0 W max), 8 ohm, 90 dB, PEEK cone, Nd-Fe-B magnet, solder-pad terminals. Body is 15 x 11 x 3 mm and the two solder pads are **0.6 mm square, on the left and right sides**, both read from the datasheet's mechanical drawing. Pad centres are at +/-7.2 mm, so 14.4 mm apart, with each pad's outer edge flush with the 15 mm body end; that is the drawing's pad-to-edge figure read as 'flush', which is the one number worth a second look. Pin 1 is the '+' terminal: per the datasheet the cone moves forward with positive dc on '+', so pin 1 takes SPK_P. Drawn for o1next issue #324; see the README beside it.")
	(tags "speaker audio 15x11x3mm 8ohm SameSky CMS-151103-088SP solder-pad")
